Description:
  Wraps the 'MUI X Tree View' React components <https://mui.com/x/react-tree-view/>
  for use in 'shiny' applications and 'quarto' documents, letting users navigate
  hierarchical data with nested levels that can be expanded and collapsed. Bundles
  the MIT-licensed community edition of the '@mui/x-tree-view' JavaScript library
  (the commercial 'Pro' tier is not included).
